# High Contrast -- maximum separation on true black.
#
# Not a mood. This is the accessibility option, and it is also the one to check
# against whenever a colour stops being distinguishable in one of the others:
# if two things are hard to tell apart here, they are wrong everywhere.

name    High Contrast
blurb   Maximum separation on true black.

# --- interface roles -------------------------------------------------------
ui      canvas      000000
ui      panel       000000
ui      border      FFFFFF
ui      title       FFEB00
ui      text        FFFFFF
ui      muted       C8C8C8
ui      accent      35E4FF
ui      selection   404040  F5

